{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51652","headline":"功臣堂（幷序） · 钱鏐","name":"功臣堂（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今夕虽非丰沛酒，醪觥同醉洽吾乡。\n两邦父老趋旌府，百品肴羞宴桂堂。\n宝剑已颁王礼盛，锦衣重带御炉香。\n越王册後封吴王，大国宣恩达万方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}